# Production: assets are NOT bundled. They are downloaded on-demand at runtime
# from the asset CDN via VITE_ASSET_PATH. The app fetches manifest.json, all
# trait/character-assets, sound, ktx2, hdr, and lora-assets by URL through this
# base path, so pointing it at the CDN IS download-on-load.
#
# Cloudflare R2 custom domain. Bucket: everywear-assets. Prefix: character-studio/.
VITE_ASSET_PATH=https://assets.everywear.id/character-studio
